      }
    ],
    "discovery_basis": "On 2026-11-28 I searched the lgt sources for axial, temporal, Polyakov, center and Bianchi statements. The only axial-gauge content is the pass-through faddeevPopov. Web search for Lean lattice gauge theory found further unaudited GitHub projects; these were not exhaustively checked."
  },
